<title>ITALY: Global oil meeting to be held in Italy next March.</title>
<headline>Global oil meeting to be held in Italy next March.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The third Off-shore Mediterranean Conference (OMC) will be held in the northeast Italian city of Ravenna from March 19-21, 1997, the organisers said.</p>
<p>The main theme will be &quot;prospects and challenges for the oil industry and the role of the Mediterranean in the production and consumption of gas in the third millenium&quot;, a statement said.</p>
<p>Taking part in the three-day meeting, being held in Ravenna as the last one two years ago, will be senior energy officials from North Africa, the former Soviet Union, the European Union and OPEC.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
